{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026dkRXlUFxHK1793285650.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港島舂磡角一間獨立屋，報稱兩條頸鏈懷疑被人偷走，總值超過4,000萬元。<br/></p><p>現場是舂磡角道42號紫荊園一間獨立屋，據了解，屋內無安裝閉路電視。警方表示，單位女戶主前日從英國返港，發現收藏在衣帽間兩條名貴頸鏈不見了，在住所及辦公室搜尋不果，於是報警。</p><p></p><p>消息指事主報稱離港期間，屋內只有母親及兩名女傭。警方將案件列作盜竊，暫時未有人被捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:54.527804+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T13:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T22:38:17.474361+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T15:38:30.669326+00:00","content_hash":"42a5954ad1e19426e33143fb6474e827bf88247b659c7303912a98961c2707fc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}